10. Transfer. The Licensor may transfer the rights in the Players, including this licence, to another
    person or company; this licence then continues unchanged with the new rightsholder. You may
    transfer it only together with Your Product or the business that makes it.
11. Law. This licence is governed by the laws of England and Wales.
